<p><strong>Disclosure and Distribution of Data:</strong> Within the limits of the purposes described above, the personal data (including photographs and audio/video recordings) may be shared with companies affiliated with the KADEO GROUP Consortium ● Via Galileo Ferraris 63, 52100 Arezzo (AR), Italy ● VAT No. 02530190517 ● PEC: kadeogroup@pec.it, as well as through the Consortium's websites, social media channels and other communication platforms.</p>
